name: the control keys page (ui_option_control_keys.cpp) from the chat panel's Options tab, shown and cancelled
# Picking 'Control' builds UIOptionControlKeysClass (mode 1): 'Control Options', six category buttons and a list of
# key rows, each row two gd_key_press.cpp KeyPressGadgets (primary, alternate; 0x66A700). The page reads no file of
# its own name (its model comes from the art mix files), so the checks are the standing no-CRASH (the gadget list
# walk of InterfaceClass::Unknown_7C crashed while KeyPressGadget was a stand-in), the shot, and the world taking
# input again after Cancel (` targets self: REQUEST_TARGET).
timeout: 400
include _login
click gadget chat.tab.options
alive 0.5
click gadget options.control
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed mouse 0x201 at 508, 91'
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
shot option_control
click gadget optctl.cancel
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
shot option_control_closed
key 0xC0
expect-event antprox 'received REQUEST_TARGET 0x0017, 8 bytes' within 10
